
<section class="section-pad" style="padding:5rem 0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px;">
    <div style="text-align:center; max-width:680px; margin:0 auto 3rem;">
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 4.5rem); margin-bottom:1rem;">Apply. Press. Go.</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem;">A quick routine that keeps you looking finished.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="aspect-ratio:16/9; background:hsl(var(--accent-lemon)); border-radius:1.75rem; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:3rem; text-align:center;">
      <div><span style="display:block; font-size:3rem;">▶</span><strong style="color:hsl(var(--accent));">Demo video placeholder</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-category-grid" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:1.25rem; margin-bottom:3rem;">
      <div style="background:hsl(var(--secondary)); padding:1.5rem; border-radius:1.5rem;"><strong>1. Prep</strong><div style="margin-top:0.5rem; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.75);">Clean and dry nails. Push cuticles gently. Choose sizes from the 15 included.</div></div>
      <div style="background:hsl(var(--secondary)); padding:1.5rem; border-radius:1.5rem;"><strong>2. Apply</strong><div style="margin-top:0.5rem; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.75);">Use your adhesive method. Align the nail to your cuticle line and press firmly for 30 seconds.</div></div>
      <div style="background:hsl(var(--secondary)); padding:1.5rem; border-radius:1.5rem;"><strong>3. Press</strong><div style="margin-top:0.5rem; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.75);">Hold each nail down firmly. The warmth from your fingers activates the adhesive bond.</div></div>
      <div style="background:hsl(var(--secondary)); padding:1.5rem; border-radius:1.5rem;"><strong>4. Remove</strong><div style="margin-top:0.5rem; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.75);">Soak and loosen slowly in warm water. Never force-pull — patience protects your natural nails.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div style="max-width:760px; margin:0 auto;">
      <h2 style="font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:center;">Common questions</h2>
      <div style="display:grid; gap:0.75rem;">
        <details style="border:1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius:1rem; padding:0 1rem; background:white;"><summary style="padding:1rem 0; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer;">How long does it last?</summary><div style="padding-bottom:1rem; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.75);">With proper application, typical wear is around 7 days. Results vary based on activity and application.</div></details>
        <details style="border:1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius:1rem; padding:0 1rem; background:white;"><summary style="padding:1rem 0; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer;">Do I need a size guide?</summary><div style="padding-bottom:1rem; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.75);">Each Chinchoo set includes 30 nails across 15 sizes — enough to find the perfect fit for every finger.</div></details>
        <details style="border:1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius:1rem; padding:0 1rem; background:white;"><summary style="padding:1rem 0; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer;">Can I reuse them?</summary><div style="padding-bottom:1rem; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.75);">Yes! With gentle removal and proper storage, your Chinchoo nails can be reapplied.</div></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
